# The signed approvals, part `password-prompt`: the approvals password,
# typed at a terminal and in the application. Written with the code.

# ------------------------------------------------ type-ahead and its rule

[break] the-terminal-prompt-takes-keys-before-its-field-is-shown
rule: At a terminal, the password's field takes no key until the dialogs' rule says it is ready: keys on their way when the prompt was drawn, and typing that runs on into it, are dropped.
file: crates/cineris-tui/src/secret/password.rs
in: ask_on
find: let takes = !typed_ahead && ready.takes_keys(came);
replace: let takes = !typed_ahead;
caught-by:
    cineris-tui secret::password::tests::at_a_terminal_keys_before_the_field_is_shown_are_dropped

[break] the-password-dialog-takes-keys-before-it-is-ready
rule: In the application, the password dialog takes no key until the dialogs' rule says it is ready: the keys queued when it opens and the typing that runs on into it are dropped.
file: crates/cineris-tui/src/app/state/password.rs
in: App::password_event
find: let takes = dialog.ready.takes_keys(pressed);
replace: let takes = true;
caught-by:
    cineris-tui app::state::password::tests::keys_and_pastes_go_to_it_alone_and_never_to_the_input_box

[break] keys-reach-the-input-box-under-the-password-dialog
rule: While the password dialog is open, every key and paste is its own or nobody's: never the input box's.
file: crates/cineris-tui/src/app/state.rs
in: App::terminal
find: self.password_event(event, at)
replace: None::<bool>
caught-by:
    cineris-tui app::state::password::tests::keys_and_pastes_go_to_it_alone_and_never_to_the_input_box

[break] the-terminal-stays-open-to-other-programs
rule: While the password prompt is up at a terminal, the terminal's exclusive mode is on, so that no program that was not reading it can open it.
file: crates/cineris-tui/src/secret/password.rs
in: read_password_answered
find: let _ = terminal.set_exclusive(true);
replace:
caught-by:
    cineris-tui secret::password::tests::at_a_terminal_the_terminal_is_closed_to_others_while_the_prompt_is_up

# ------------------------------------------------ what a password is

[break] a-pasted-password-is-trimmed
rule: A password is not trimmed: the spaces at the ends of what is typed or pasted are its own.
file: crates/cineris-tui/src/secret/password.rs
in: PasswordInput::paste
find: self.buffer.push_str(without_line_end(text))
replace: self.buffer.push_str(without_line_end(text).trim())
caught-by:
    cineris-tui secret::password::tests::a_password_is_not_trimmed_and_may_be_any_text_but_control_characters
    cineris-tui secret::password::tests::at_a_terminal_a_paste_is_taken_and_one_with_a_line_break_inside_is_refused

[break] a-chosen-password-may-have-eleven-characters
rule: A password chosen has at least 12 characters, counted as Unicode scalar values.
file: crates/cineris-tui/src/secret/password.rs
in: PasswordPrompt::submit
find: typed.chars() < Password::LEAST
replace: typed.chars() < Password::LEAST - 1
caught-by:
    cineris-tui secret::password::tests::a_chosen_password_has_at_least_twelve_characters
    cineris-tui secret::password::tests::at_a_terminal_a_password_is_chosen_by_typing_it_twice

[break] a-chosen-password-typed-differently-is-kept
rule: A password chosen is kept only when its second typing is the first, byte for byte; otherwise both are dropped and the choice starts again.
file: crates/cineris-tui/src/secret/password.rs
in: PasswordPrompt::submit
find: Some(first) if first.same_as(&typed)
replace: Some(first) if !first.is_empty()
caught-by:
    cineris-tui secret::password::tests::a_chosen_password_typed_differently_the_second_time_is_asked_again
    cineris-tui secret::password::tests::at_a_terminal_a_password_is_chosen_by_typing_it_twice

# ------------------------------------------------ nothing kept

[break] esc-leaves-the-password-in-its-field
rule: `Esc` and `Ctrl+C` answer the prompt with nothing and write over what its field held.
file: crates/cineris-tui/src/secret/password.rs
in: PasswordPrompt::cancel
find: self.input.clear();
replace:
caught-by:
    cineris-tui secret::password::tests::esc_and_ctrl_c_answer_with_nothing_and_wipe_everything
